---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/site/Header.astro";
import FloatingFooter from "../components/site/FloatingFooter.astro";
---

<SiteLayout title="Privacy Policy — Comet Client" description="Comet Client Privacy Policy.">
  <Header />
  <main class="flex min-h-screen flex-col">
    <div class="hero-concept hero-concept--short relative h-64 sm:h-72">
      <div class="hero-concept__bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="relative z-[1] flex h-full items-end">
        <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 pb-10 sm:px-6">
          <p class="font-pixel text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] text-white/40">Legal &amp; Privacy</p>
          <h1 class="font-pixel mt-2 text-4xl text-gradient-gold sm:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <article class="page-body legal-prose mx-auto max-w-3xl flex-1 px-4 py-14 sm:px-6">
      <p>We respect your privacy. This policy outlines what we collect and why. We do not collect any data that is not necessary for the operation of the launcher.</p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        Anonymous crash reports, basic usage analytics (which features are used), and your
        Minecraft username for cosmetics rendering. We also collect necessary data to operate the launcher, such as the version of the launcher you are using.
      </p>

      <h2>What we don't collect</h2>
      <p>
        We never collect chat messages, world data, IP logs beyond the session, or your
        Microsoft password. We do pass your session token to the launching core but never store it on our servers.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>Our website uses essential cookies only. No third-party trackers. We do not use any cookies to track your activity on our website. It's only used to ensure the website is working correctly.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You may request deletion of any data we hold about you by emailing us at <a href="mailto:privacy@cometclient.dev">privacy@cometclient.dev</a> (if we even have any).
      </p>
    </article>

    <FloatingFooter />
  </main>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .legal-prose :global(h2) {
    font-family: 'MultiTypePixel', 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: hsl(0 0% 100% / 0.9);
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .legal-prose :global(p) {
    color: hsl(0 0% 100% / 0.55);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
</style>
